The turn/block trace model, the trace-source and unit abstraction, the
indexing tiers, and the overlapping content-addressed chunker in
internal/trace/ are ported from funes' Rust implementation to Go.
Modifications: the port targets a Layer/turbopuffer namespace rather than a
local Lance dataset, and omits funes' embedding, reranking and rank-fusion
stages, which run in the store.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes software ported from Weave
(https://github.com/hev/weave), Copyright the Weave authors, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The recipe, bundle, digest, assessment, diff and reviewer implementation in
internal/weave/ (hev context) is ported from Weave's Go prototype.
Modifications: command help and the reviewer's diff hint name hev context;
source path checks walk from the volume root so they work on Windows; small
exported helpers let dispatch decode recipes and publish and verify bundles.
Bundle bytes and digests are unchanged.
